OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F346A1787789950
OL,3,CCoventry City promoted to the Premier
OL,4,CLeague for first time since 2001
OL,6,FFor those travelling Coventry fans who
OL,7,Fmade the 260-mile round trip, tonight
OL,8,Fmarks an occasion that they'll never
OL,9,Fforget.
OL,11,FIt's their first time back since 2001,
OL,12,Fwhen they were relegated along with
OL,13,FBradford City and Manchester City
OL,14,Funder Gordon Strachan.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
