PN,34603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F346A1787789950
OL,3,CCoventry City promoted to the Premier
OL,4,CLeague for first time since 2001
OL,6,FSince then, the club have been
OL,7,Frelegated all the way down to League
OL,8,FTwo and faced financial crises and
OL,9,Fadministration battles. It was only
OL,10,Flast year when the club became the
OL,11,Fowner of its home stadium after so
OL,12,Fmuch uncertainty around their home.
OL,14,FNow the supporters can revel in the
OL,15,Fgood times with a return to the top
OL,16,Fflight.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
