OL,3,CCoventry City promoted to the Premier
OL,4,CLeague for first time since 2001
OL,6,FCoventry now look set for the
OL,7,FChampionship title, but they will have
OL,8,Fto wait to secure it, with second-
OL,9,Fplaced Ipswich now 11 points behind
OL,10,Fand five matches still to play.
OL,12,FWant more on Coventry City? Head to
OL,13,FITVX to watch 'Coventry City: The
OL,14,FResurrection', featuring exclusive
OL,15,Fclips with Frank Lampard
